        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 381.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 Which of the following colours can’t be described as electric?"
      },
      {
        "y": 355.1,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 322.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A black B green C blue"
      },
      {
        "y": 367.8,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 338.5,
        "tag": "main",
