        "text": "A green B orange C yellow"
      },
      {
        "y": 392.5,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 499.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 If a speaker comments that a lipstick is rather a harsh red, what does the speaker think of"
      },
      {
        "y": 404.5,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 177.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "the lipstick?"
      },
      {
        "y": 416.5,
