        "x1": 285.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A She likes it. B She doesn’t like it."
      },
      {
        "y": 428.5,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 368.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C We don’t know – she’s stating a fact not giving an opinion."
      },
      {
        "y": 441.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 357.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 Which is the closest synonym of a bright pink material?"
      },
      {
        "y": 453.2,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 496.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A a material with a tinge of pink B a vivid pink material C a pinkish material"
