        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 483.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Look at C opposite. Match the situations on the left with the responses on the right."
      },
      {
        "y": 489.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 489.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 That child looks a bit green. a No, they make me feel sick."
      },
      {
        "y": 501.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 505,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 He seems to have the blues most days. b Yes, it’s not at all clear what we"
      },
      {
        "y": 513.2,
        "x0": 375.6,
        "x1": 419.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "should do."
      },
      {
        "y": 525.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 513.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "3 That TV programme always makes him see red. c Yes, but they need qualifications."
      },
      {
        "y": 537.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 490.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "4 It’s a bit of a grey area, isn’t it? d I think he’s going to be sick."
      },
      {
        "y": 549.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 524.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "5 They seem to be trying to blacken his name. e Yes, they want to do their bit for the"
      },
      {
        "y": 561.2,
        "x0": 375.6,
        "x1": 432.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "environment."
      },
      {
        "y": 573.2,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 512.7,
        "tag": "main",
